                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", Head of the Aga Khan Library and Associate Professor at AKU-ISMC, has published a new chapter on "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Humour in Islamic Literature and Muslim Practices: Virtue or Vice?",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " in the book "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Muslims and Humour: Essays on Comedy, Joking, and Mirth in Contemporary Islamic Contexts",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://bristoluniversitypress.co.uk/muslims-and-humour",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
